{"3943230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fox! Hen! Bag! - Supporter Edition", "steam_appid": 3943230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short first-person adventure game, you have to bring your friends over to the other mountain by using a tramway car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Each friend has their own agenda. You have to talk to them to decide which order they should be moved in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A first-person adventure where you move the characters between mountains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Based on a classic riddle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore a small yet atmospheric world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Supporter Edition?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original &quot;Fox! Hen! Bag!&quot; will remain available for free, but we can no longer update it due to technical limitations. This &quot;Supporter Edition&quot; is rebuilt from scratch, allowing us to improve and expand the game over time. While the core gameplay remains the same, purchasing this edition supports future development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improvements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5 (future-proof and maintainable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Deck compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and control configuration options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced effects and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing updates and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future content additions planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short first-person adventure game, you have to bring your friends over to the other mountain by using a tramway car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Each friend has their own agenda. You have to talk to them to decide which order they should be moved in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A first-person adventure where you move the characters between mountains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Based on a classic riddle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore a small yet atmospheric world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Supporter Edition?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original &quot;Fox! Hen! Bag!&quot; will remain available for free, but we can no longer update it due to technical limitations. This &quot;Supporter Edition&quot; is rebuilt from scratch, allowing us to improve and expand the game over time. While the core gameplay remains the same, purchasing this edition supports future development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improvements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5 (future-proof and maintainable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Deck compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and control configuration options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced effects and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing updates and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future content additions planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In this short first-person adventure game, you have to bring your friends over to the other mountain by using a tramway car. But beware! Each friend has their own agenda. You have to talk to them to decide which order they should be moved in. Based on a classic riddle.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943230/e5c4104a196f6a413f50c97f8efc9fb3db94badc/header.jpg?t=1770665345", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943230/ced41cb8bc70d10337c96e8d6d1cd0e00f3fa60a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770665345", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943230/ced41cb8bc70d10337c96e8d6d1cd0e00f3fa60a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770665345", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1909 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1909 or higher) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti 8GB / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<